Subject: [PATCH] Add EIP: Batched KZG Point Evaluation via EIP-2537

Informational EIP describing how to verify n EIP-4844 blob openings with
two BLS12_G1MSM calls and one BLS12_PAIRING_CHECK call (EIP-2537) instead
of n point-evaluation precompile calls, using a Fiat-Shamir random linear
combination. Covers the general shape and the two shared-value shapes,
the versioned-hash binding that bypassing 0x0A removes, the measured
crossover against the per-opening precompile, and a reference
implementation with one fixture per shape and the gas measurements.

